# Operator/private client examples for source HTTP1.24. Inspect live OpenAPI before use.
# The Lovable application consumes these operations through the existing Supabase Edge function.
# Put the original user's token only in the HTTP client's private local environment.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:6086
@accessToken =
@organization = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@job = replace-with-admitted-search-job-uuid
@indexSha256 = replace-with-completed-index-sha256
@fileId = 0
@offset = 0

### One explicit fixed-source demonstration;202 is admission, not completion or a customer website finding
# Persist requestId before sending. Reconcile uncertainty with this SAME UUID and sourceId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "2f441397-f8c9-4c70-b6b7-39e847225f5b",
  "sourceId": "search-working"
}

### Latest independent demo; null stays null, no customer review or example is substituted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The exact admitted job; reads do not renew input authority
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Verified four keyboard attempts, separate pointer comparison and primary video IDs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Original file descriptors; offset is a multiple of24; follow nextOffset until null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}/files/{{offset}}/{{indexSha256}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Original-byte page; ordinary offset is a64KiB boundary, or the exact file length for EOF
# Verify every page SHA and the whole original SHA, then reauthorize at exact EOF before delivery.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}/originals/{{fileId}}/{{offset}}/{{indexSha256}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### At most three retained storage-only publication attempts; never input replay
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}/diagnostics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Revoke future authority; already dispatched input cannot be reversed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/search-demonstrations/{{job}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
